{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33319","headline":"拟古讽 · 于濆","name":"拟古讽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳大道傍，甲第何深邃。\n南亩无一廛，东园有余地。\n春溪化桃李，秋沼生荷芰。\n草木本无情，此时如有爲。\n旱苗当垄死，流水资嘉致。\n余心甘至愚，不会皇天意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}